./docs/research/1888-wg-timers/agy-plan-r2.md:12:*   **AGY F3 (mid-tick deadline busy-spin): RESOLVED**
./docs/research/1888-wg-timers/agy-plan-r2.md:13:    The control loop now runs the timer pass whenever `now >= next_deadline` or the 1s tick elapses, correctly avoiding zero-timeout busy-spinning on sub-second deadlines.
