codex
One more design flaw surfaced: a scalar `queue_count` only describes a contiguous prefix of queues. If the permanently unbound queue is an interior queue, “drop that queue and reduce queue_count” cannot represent the physical RX topology without causing either same-queue drops or cross-queue redirects.
